            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>Experience the thrill of VR sailing in this breathtaking experience using your HTC Vive!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2>This <strong>FREE</strong> experience lets you test your sailing skills on a realistic water simulation and in 3 different weather conditions. <br>This VR simulation is really easy on motion sickness due to special camera implementation and &quot;cockpit effect&quot;. <br>You can use your Vive controllers to interact with the ship like a real sailor! <br>There is not any purchases inside the game, this is 100% Free!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Outstanding water effect and simulation. <br></li><li>Realistic wind, sails and boat movement. <br></li><li>3 different weather conditions: day, night &amp; storm. <br></li><li>Motion sickness free! (If you can handle the storm :) )</li></ul>",
