                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This VR app is really a great start. I am a sailor, and I swear I could feel the boat moving under me. Three BIG things I'd like to see added:\n1. (and most importantly) Telltales on the shrouds. That way you could really see which way the wind was blowing. It was difficult to tell if I was on a beat or on a reach.\n2. Functioning main sheet to pull the boom in on a beat or let it out on a reach.\n3. A binnacle or other compass arrangement so you could see your heading.\n\nGreat start...I love it.",
